('C01_K07',2,'inputs/C01_K07.png','Show trainee actually lowering himself to imitate coach','The woman in burgundy is already lying on the mat with one arm raised and one knee bent. She maintains EXACTLY this pose without lowering it throughout. The photographer remains crouched at screen left with his camera. ONLY the teal tracksuit man moves: he steps toward the clear space beside the woman, bends his knees, sits carefully, then lowers his back onto the mat beside her and raises the same arm and bent knee to copy her pose. Both bodies remain separate with clear space between them. He finishes parallel to her, head on the same side as her head, feet on the same side as her feet. Hold the two matching poses for the last two seconds. The coach never disappears, gets up or changes pose. The photographer never moves into their space. Keep the rolling chair stationary.'+COMMON),
('C04_K09',2,'inputs/C04_K09.png','One spoon extraction rather than two spoons','The armored commander in the foreground looks toward the open food trolley. His right hand reaches inside his own cloak at his chest, then withdraws ONE short wooden eating spoon. He holds this single spoon visibly near his chest, glancing expectantly toward the food. His left hand stays EMPTY and still at his side for the whole shot. Only one spoon belongs to the commander. Do not give him a bowl or second utensil. The three hungry occupants already at the horse windows each continue holding their own one bowl and one spoon without moving the shutters. The elderly guard and recorder remain in place. The food lid stays open. No eating, serving or walking.'+COMMON),
('C01_K06_pose',1,'frames/C01_K06_take01/08_4.000s.png','Clean two-arm pose formation after accepted landing','The burgundy tracksuit woman has already landed on her back on the mat. She remains lying down. She slowly raises ONLY her existing right arm diagonally toward the ceiling and bends ONLY her right knee to lift the right foot. Her left arm stays flat alongside her body on the mat and her left leg stays extended. There are exactly two arms and two legs, each continuously attached to her body. She confidently holds this ridiculous presentation pose for the final four seconds. No second fall, sitting up, rolling, extra limb or changing chair. The two standing observers stay still at the right, looking at her. The rolling chair remains fixed where it is.'+COMMON),
('C01_K05',3,'inputs/C01_K05.png','Both outgoing people cross actual left doorway','The blue shirt man and yellow tracksuit woman leave together through the already OPEN doorway at far screen left. They turn toward that doorway, walk through the opening one after the other, and both fully disappear naturally behind the LEFT door jamb into the corridor by second five. They remain outside for the final three seconds. They never walk behind the teal observer or return to the room. The burgundy coach, teal observer and gray-shirt photographer remain in their original places and look toward the departing pair. No other person moves. The chair stays stationary and the coach does not sit yet. The doorway and door leaf remain fixed and fully open.'+COMMON),
('C04_K01_insert',1,'inputs/C04_K01.png','Single request inserted and hand withdrawn empty','Focus on the stocky curly-haired man at the RIGHT. He takes ONLY his own small paper request and inserts that single paper fully into the already open large envelope with the purple crescent. His other hand holds the envelope steady. Once the paper has gone inside, he withdraws the inserting hand EMPTY and holds it beside the envelope. Nothing is pulled out. The older gray-haired woman at left and young dark-haired man in center keep holding their own papers; they do not simultaneously insert or remove anything. Exactly one paper enters the envelope. Keep the same three characters, their hungry expressions, the confined wooden interior, envelope and crescent.'+COMMON),
